{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44689","headline":"书遗文後 · 僧凤","name":"书遗文後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦哉黑闇女，乐矣功德天。\n智者俱不受，愚夫纳二边。\n我奉能仁教，归依弥勒前。\n愿阐摩诃衍，成就那罗延。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧凤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}